## Top Kenyan Universities

Rankings combine UNIRANKS 2026, Times Higher Education Impact 2025, and EduRank Africa 2024.

### Public Universities

#### 1. University of Nairobi (UoN)
- **National rank:** #1 | **Global:** Top 1,000 (UNIRANKS 2026 — only Kenyan university)
- **Students:** 84,000+
- **Strongest departments:** Medicine & Surgery, Law (LLB), Engineering, Architecture, Veterinary Medicine, Economics, Journalism
- Kenya's oldest and most research-intensive university

#### 2. Kenyatta University (KU)
- **National rank:** #2 | Outperformed UoN in Times Higher Education 2025/2026
- **Students:** 50,000+
- **Strongest departments:** Education (all levels), Health Sciences, Engineering & Technology, Environmental Studies, Business, Pure Sciences

#### 3. JKUAT
- **National rank:** #3–4 | **Africa rank:** #59 (UNIRANKS)
- **Location:** Juja; campuses also in Arusha (Tanzania) and Kigali (Rwanda)
- **Strongest departments:** Engineering (top-rated nationally), Computer Science & IT, Architecture, Agriculture, Food Science, Built Environment

#### 4. Moi University
- **National rank:** #5 | **Africa rank:** #62
- **Location:** Eldoret (flagship); multiple campuses across the country
- **Strongest departments:** Medicine, Law, Engineering, Education, Forest Resources, Environmental Science
- Leading university in the Rift Valley and western Kenya region

#### 5. Egerton University
- **National rank:** #6 | **Africa rank:** #86
- **Location:** Njoro, Nakuru County
- **Strongest departments:** Agriculture (flagship — Kenya's oldest agricultural university), Veterinary Sciences, Food Science, Environmental Science, Education

#### 6. Maseno University
- **National rank:** Top 10
- **Location:** Maseno, Kisumu County
- **Strongest departments:** Medicine, Education, Business, Pure Sciences, Social Sciences

#### 7. Technical University of Kenya (TUK)
- **National rank:** Top 10 | **Africa rank:** ~#121
- **Location:** Nairobi
- **Strongest departments:** Applied Sciences, Engineering Technology, Architecture, Surveying, IT

